ext":"The sons of Cush: Seba, Havilah, Sabta, Raama, Sabteca. The sons of Raamah: Sheba and Dedan."},{"verse":10,"text":"Cush became the father of Nimrod. He began to be a mighty one on the earth."},{"verse":11,"text":"Mizraim became the father of Ludim, Anamim, Lehabim, Naphtuhim,"},{"verse":12,"text":"Pathrusim, Casluhim (where the Philistines came from), and Caphtorim."},{"verse":13,"text":"Canaan became the father of Sidon his firstborn, Heth,"},{"verse":14,"text":"the Jebusite, the Amorite, the Girgashite,"},{"verse":15,"text":"the Hivite, the Arkite, the Sinite,"},{"verse":16,"text":"the Arvadite, the Zemarite, and the Hamathite."},{"verse":17,"text":"The sons of Shem: Elam, Asshur, Arpachshad, Lud, Aram, Uz, Hul, Gether, and Meshech."},{"verse":18,"text":"Arpachshad became the father of Shelah, and Shelah became the father of Eber."},{"verse":19,"text":"To Eber were born two sons: the name of the one was Peleg, for in his days the earth was divided; and his brother’s name was Joktan."},{"verse":20,"text":"Joktan became the father of Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,"},{"verse":21,"text":"Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,"},{"verse":22,"text":"Ebal, Abimael, Sheba,"},{"verse":23,"text":"Ophir, Havilah, and Jobab. All these were the sons of Joktan."},{"verse":24,"text":"Shem, Arpachshad, Shelah,"},{"verse":25,"text":"Eber, Peleg, Reu,"},{"verse":26,"text":"Serug, Nahor, Terah,"},{"verse":27,"text":"Abram (also called Abraham)."},{"verse":28,"text":"The sons of Abraham: Isaac and Ishmael."},{"verse":29,"text":"These are their generations: the firstborn of Ishmael, Nebaioth; then Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,"},{"verse":30,"text":"Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema,"},{"verse":31,"text":"Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah. These are the sons of Ishmael."},{"verse":32,"text":"The sons of Keturah, Abraham’s concubine: she bore Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, and Shuah. The sons of Jokshan: Sheba and Dedan."},{"verse":33,"text":"The sons of Midian: Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, and Eldaah. All these were the sons of Keturah."},{"verse":34,"text":"Abraham became the father of Isaac. The sons of Isaac: Esau and Israel."},{"verse":35,"text":"The sons of Esau: Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, and Korah."},{"verse":36,"text":"The sons of Eliphaz: Teman, Omar, Zephi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna, and Amalek."},{"verse":37,"text":"The sons of Reuel: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah."},{"verse":38,"text":"The sons of Seir: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan."},{"verse":39,"text":"The sons of Lotan: Hori and Homam; and Timna was Lotan’s sister."},{"verse":40,"text":"The sons of Shobal: Alian, Manahath, Ebal, Shephi, and Onam. The sons of Zibeon: Aiah and Anah."},{"verse":41,"text":"The son of Anah: Dishon. The sons of Dishon: Hamran, Eshban, Ithran, and Cheran."},{"verse":42,"text":"The sons of Ezer: Bilhan, Zaavan, and Jaakan. The sons of Dishan: Uz and Aran."},{"verse":43,"text":"Now these are the kings who reigned in the land of Edom, before any king reigned over the children of Israel: Bela the son of Beor; and the name of his city was Dinhabah."},{"verse":44,"text":"Bela died, and Jobab the son of Zerah of Bozrah reigned in his place."},{"verse":45,"text":"Jobab died, and Husham of the land of the Temanites reigned in his place."},{"verse":46,"text":"Husham died, and Hadad the son of Bedad, who struck Midian in the field of Moab, reigned in his place; and the name of his city was Avith."},{"verse":47,"text":"Hadad died, and Samlah of Masrekah reigned in his place."},{"verse":48,"text":"Samlah died, and Shaul of Rehoboth by the River reigned in his place."},{"verse":49,"text":"Shaul died, and Baal Hanan the son of Achbor reigned in his place."},{"verse":50,"text":"Baal Hanan died, and Hadad reigned in his place; and the name of his city was Pai. His wife’s name was Mehetabel, the daughter of Matred, the daughter of Mezahab."},{"verse":51,"text":"Then Hadad died. The chiefs of Edom were: chief Timna, chief Aliah, chief Jetheth,"},{"verse":52,"text":"chief Oholibamah, chief Elah, chief Pinon,"},{"verse":53,"text":"chief Kenaz, chief Teman, chief Mibzar,"},{"verse":54,"text":"chief Magdiel, and chief Iram. These are the chiefs of Edom."}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]}]